=== hash-literal-zip-keys-values
from: DB 0.5 lib/DB/Result.rakumod:26
license: BSD-2-Clause
feature: infix Z=>
--- code
my class Result {
    has @.keys = <id name>;
    method hash(@row) { %( @!keys.list Z=> @row ) }
}
my %h = Result.new.hash([7, 'seven']);
say %h<id>, ' ', %h<name>;
--- expect
7 seven

